ICDD(8)                     System Manager's Manual                    ICDD(8)

NAME
     icdd – ImageCapture Discovery Daemon

SYNOPSIS
     icdd

DESCRIPTION
     icdd is a system daemon responsible for matching devices containing
     images with the appropriate driver modules.

     There are no configuration options to icdd, and users should not run icdd
     manually.

